    evaluation: "Each practice is reviewed on its review interval and after any incident or near miss that involves its hazard. Inspections check that practices are followed. The number of hazards without a practice and practices overdue for review are reported to management.",
    records: "The practice register, versions, acknowledgements and reviews",
    references: OHS_REFS,
