    responsibilities: "Management funds training and provides time for it. {{company.safetyManager}} maintains the training matrix and verifies certificates. Supervisors check the matrix before assigning work. Dispatch does not dispatch a worker whose required certificate is missing, expired or unverified where the requirement is blocking. Workers keep their certificates current and upload renewals.",
    requirements: "The training matrix in LeaseOS lists, for every position, each required external certificate, company training, client orientation, policy acknowledgement and equipment competency, with its renewal interval and whether a gap blocks dispatch, requires review or is informational. The matrix is recomputed whenever a requirement, a worker or a certificate changes. Expiring certificates are flagged before they expire.",
